IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. YEAR-CENTURY-03.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 YY-YEAR PIC 9(2).
05 TODAY-YEAR PIC 9(4).
05 SIGNED-DELTA PIC S9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-YEAR PIC 9(4).
05 OUT-AGE PIC S9(4) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
05 OUT-MAGNITUDE PIC 9(2).
05 OUT-MARK PIC X(1) VALUE "R".
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 FULL-YEAR PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 AGE PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
OPEN INPUT INFILE
OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE
IF IN-STATUS = "00"
    READ INFILE AT END
        MOVE "E" TO OUT-MARK
    END-READ
    IF IN-STATUS = "00"
        PERFORM CALCULATE
        WRITE OUT-REC
    END-IF
END-IF
CLOSE INFILE
CLOSE OUTFILE
STOP RUN.
CALCULATE.
COMPUTE FULL-YEAR = 2100 + YY-YEAR END-COMPUTE
MOVE TODAY-YEAR TO AGE
SUBTRACT FULL-YEAR FROM AGE END-SUBTRACT
MOVE FULL-YEAR TO OUT-YEAR
MOVE AGE TO OUT-AGE
MOVE SIGNED-DELTA TO OUT-MAGNITUDE
.
